00:51:58,701 --> 00:52:00,071
I have plum syrup at home.

1261
00:52:00,241 --> 00:52:03,381
My mom's plum syrup tea.

1262
00:52:04,381 --> 00:52:05,541
I don't even know what to say.

1263
00:52:06,251 --> 00:52:07,681
With the slightest sign of an upset stomach,

1264
00:52:08,111 --> 00:52:09,151
I have the plum syrup.

1265
00:52:09,151 --> 00:52:10,921
(His love for plums continues.)

1266
00:52:11,681 --> 00:52:13,491
(Already a pocketful to match his love for plums)

1267
00:52:13,751 --> 00:52:15,321
It's easy, isn't it, You Seok?

1268
00:52:15,321 --> 00:52:17,491
Of course, compared to the eels.

1269
00:52:17,491 --> 00:52:18,921
- Totally.
- Guys.

1270
00:52:18,921 --> 00:52:20,731
Let's pick a bunch and fast at that.

1271
00:52:20,731 --> 00:52:22,191
- Okay.
- We need to go help Jung Ah.

1272
00:52:22,191 --> 00:52:23,361
- Okay.
- Good.

1273
00:52:23,361 --> 00:52:25,601
- Let's work hard. For real.
- We can do this.

1274
00:52:27,531 --> 00:52:30,571
(Searching for red plums)

1275
00:52:31,371 --> 00:52:32,771
I won't miss a single plum.

1276
00:52:34,211 --> 00:52:36,511
I picked them all.

1277
00:52:37,041 --> 00:52:38,081
All done.

1278
00:52:38,081 --> 00:52:39,651
(Moving to pick more red plums)

1279
00:52:39,651 --> 00:52:40,651
Here they are.

1280
00:52:40,651 --> 00:52:45,521
(Picking plums)

1281
00:52:45,951 --> 00:52:47,491
(Catching all the plums with hawkish eyes)

1282
00:52:47,951 --> 00:52:50,491
(Starting today, I'm the plum catcher.)

1283
00:52:51,121 --> 00:52:52,561
(And next to her is...)

1284
00:52:53,431 --> 00:52:56,901
(a plum heir focused on the harvest.)

1285
00:52:59,461 --> 00:53:02,531
(Picking plums at crazy speed)

1286
00:53:04,271 --> 00:53:06,271
How much do we harvest today? All of them?

1287
00:53:06,941 --> 00:53:09,141
You're right. What's our goal weight?

1288
00:53:09,371 --> 00:53:10,581
- Like this.
- Harvest...

1289
00:53:10,581 --> 00:53:11,911
all four trees.

1290
00:53:11,911 --> 00:53:13,281
- All four?
- This, that, that, and this.

1291
00:53:13,281 --> 00:53:14,651
Four trees.

1292
00:53:14,651 --> 00:53:15,651
- Is that so?
- Yes.

1293
00:53:15,651 --> 00:53:16,921
Do we pick all four trees?

1294
00:53:16,921 --> 00:53:18,321
Yes, harvest every plum you see.

1295
00:53:18,721 --> 00:53:21,491
(So how big are the four red plum trees?)

1296
00:53:22,091 --> 00:53:23,961
(Among the lush green trees)

1297
00:53:24,391 --> 00:53:25,621
(Here)

1298
00:53:25,621 --> 00:53:26,861
(There)

1299
00:53:26,861 --> 00:53:28,061
(And here)

1300
00:53:28,991 --> 00:53:31,661
(Plums are hanging from every branch.)

1301
00:53:31,661 --> 00:53:33,701
(About 1,000 plums grow on each tree.)

1302
00:53:33,901 --> 00:53:36,441
(A challenging target of 4,000 plums to harvest)

1303
00:53:36,671 --> 00:53:38,641
I doubt we can harvest all four trees.

1304
00:53:38,641 --> 00:53:40,041
We can't.

1305
00:53:40,041 --> 00:53:41,471
(Can we pick all the plums?)

1306
00:53:41,841 --> 00:53:43,581
We'll be done in a flash. I'll pick two.

1307
00:53:44,011 --> 00:53:46,411
Okay. Let's see who can fill up one basket the fastest.

1308
00:53:46,981 --> 00:53:48,011
I'm in. Good.

1309
00:53:48,151 --> 00:53:49,151
Do you want to make a bet?

1310
00:53:49,151 --> 00:53:51,221
- What's the penalty?
- The penalty? He's...

1311
00:53:51,651 --> 00:53:52,721
Seriously, you.

1312
00:53:53,091 --> 00:53:55,221
- Or the prize.
- What do you want?

1313
00:53:55,591 --> 00:53:56,761
- Yoon Seo.
- Yes?

1314
00:53:56,821 --> 00:53:58,661
What have you been wanting the most recently?

1315
00:53:58,661 --> 00:53:59,861
I want iced coffee right now.

1316
00:54:01,491 --> 00:54:03,601
Forget that. Let's raise the stakes.

1317
00:54:03,931 --> 00:54:04,961
Raise the stakes?

1318
00:54:04,961 --> 00:54:07,101
(What could be a good prize?)

1319
00:54:07,601 --> 00:54:09,201
I don't need money.

1320
00:54:09,671 --> 00:54:14,241
You know how we make breakfast in the morning?

1321
00:54:14,371 --> 00:54:17,411
Allow me to wake up when the breakfast is all set.

1322
00:54:18,241 --> 00:54:20,011
(Taking it easy under the covers)

1323
00:54:20,511 --> 00:54:21,681
Breakfast is ready.

1324
00:54:22,151 --> 00:54:23,451
When I hear "Wake up,"

1325
00:54:23,451 --> 00:54:25,581
I'd wake up then and simply eat breakfast.

1326
00:54:25,751 --> 00:54:26,951
That's my wish.

1327
00:54:26,951 --> 00:54:28,151
(A wish of waking up slowly)

1328
00:54:28,151 --> 00:54:29,691
That's my only wish.

1329
00:54:30,491 --> 00:54:32,491
You should get Jung Ah's permission for that.

1330
00:54:33,161 --> 00:54:36,131
Won't Jung Ah allow it if we say it was the prize...

1331
00:54:36,531 --> 00:54:38,431
from a game today?

1332
00:54:39,031 --> 00:54:40,901
(Please allow it, Jung Ah.)

1333
00:54:41,371 --> 00:54:42,871
Let's do it with the wish on the line.

1334
00:54:43,771 --> 00:54:44,901
A bet?

1335
00:54:45,741 --> 00:54:47,871
I'm going to go all out, okay?

1336
00:54:49,271 --> 00:54:50,511
I'm going all out.

1337
00:54:50,511 --> 00:54:51,511
(Plum heir Kang You Seok)

1338
00:54:52,011 --> 00:54:54,081
I'm going to work really hard. I'm serious.

1339
00:54:54,411 --> 00:54:55,551
You saw that just now, right?

1340
00:54:56,321 --> 00:54:57,321
(Falling down)

1341
00:54:57,321 --> 00:54:59,521
(Madam Wasp's intimidating spirit makes the plums flee.)

1342
00:54:59,521 --> 00:55:00,651
I'm risking my life on it.

1343
00:55:01,391 --> 00:55:02,551
Where are they? I can't spot any.

1344
00:55:02,551 --> 00:55:03,661
(Plum catcher Roh Yoon Seo)

1345
00:55:03,921 --> 00:55:05,291
Is this judged based on...

1346
00:55:05,291 --> 00:55:06,891
actual weight or visual weight?

1347
00:55:07,531 --> 00:55:09,461
(The one who picks the most wins.)

1348
00:55:09,731 --> 00:55:10,931
(Who will win this bet?)

1349
00:55:10,931 --> 00:55:12,031
Okay, start.

1350
00:55:13,901 --> 00:55:16,271
There must be a method to harvest them fast.

1351
00:55:16,871 --> 00:55:18,571
I'll start with the plums hanging lower first.

1352
00:55:20,141 --> 00:55:22,141
Branches with many plums are my target.

1353
00:55:22,141 --> 00:55:26,651
(Picking up the harvest pace with plums at eye level)

1354
00:55:26,651 --> 00:55:28,381
(A determined look)

1355
00:55:28,481 --> 00:55:30,921
(I will make my wish come true.)

1356
00:55:31,851 --> 00:55:33,751
(Yoon Seo catches the plums Sun Young left behind.)

1357
00:55:34,621 --> 00:55:35,951
They're too high up.

1358
00:55:37,221 --> 00:55:38,621
Hold on. My height...

1359
00:55:39,361 --> 00:55:40,361
(Stretching)

1360
00:55:41,291 --> 00:55:42,391
(No matter how much she stretches,)

1361
00:55:42,391 --> 00:55:43,401
I can't.

1362
00:55:43,401 --> 00:55:44,601
(Yoon Seo can't reach them.)

1363
00:55:45,901 --> 00:55:46,971
Look at all of these plums.

1364
00:55:46,971 --> 00:55:47,971
(She spotted something.)

1365
00:55:50,641 --> 00:55:52,601
(A bonanza of red plums hanging low catches Yoon Seo's eyes.)

1366
00:55:52,671 --> 00:55:54,711
Twist them,

1367
00:55:55,241 --> 00:55:56,271
so that the stem...

1368
00:55:56,911 --> 00:55:59,441
So that the trunk doesn't get hurt.

1369
00:55:59,441 --> 00:56:01,181
- Twist them.
- Yoon Seo,

1370
00:56:01,181 --> 00:56:04,481
I was saving that good spot to harvest later.

1371
00:56:04,481 --> 00:56:05,681
Whatever. I came first.

1372
00:56:05,681 --> 00:56:07,551
- It's a bonanza here.
- I came... Stay away!

1373
00:56:08,951 --> 00:56:10,021
I don't care.

1374
00:56:11,491 --> 00:56:12,691
Look at all of these.

1375
00:56:13,931 --> 00:56:16,131
(Sitting down at the bonanza zone)

1376
00:56:16,131 --> 00:56:17,201
You...

1377
00:56:17,761 --> 00:56:20,231
Why are you here? This is my tree.

1378
00:56:21,030 --> 00:56:22,160
Wait, you...

1379
00:56:23,600 --> 00:56:26,060
(Picking them quickly)

1380
00:56:26,600 --> 00:56:27,630
(Pushing him down)

1381
00:56:27,630 --> 00:56:28,900
You...

1382
00:56:29,930 --> 00:56:31,000
Hey.

1383
00:56:31,530 --> 00:56:32,770
Is that how you're going to play?

1384
00:56:34,500 --> 00:56:36,840
(A battle with neither side willing to give an inch)

1385
00:56:36,840 --> 00:56:37,940
Oh, seriously.

1386
00:56:38,010 --> 00:56:40,640
(These are nobody's. It's 1st come, 1st served.)

1387
00:56:41,810 --> 00:56:45,650
(As they compete to pick the plums,)

1388
00:56:46,650 --> 00:56:48,280
(the plum-filled branches are picked clean.)

1389
00:56:48,280 --> 00:56:49,280
For real?

1390
00:56:50,590 --> 00:56:53,520
(Spilling out)

1391
00:56:53,620 --> 00:56:56,490
(I picked a bunch, right?)

1392
00:56:56,960 --> 00:57:00,700
I want to see how much they've harvested.

1393
00:57:01,200 --> 00:57:03,400
I need to do a comparison.

1394
00:57:03,830 --> 00:57:05,730
It's to adjust my pace.

1395
00:57:06,070 --> 00:57:07,570
Don't tell me they picked a ton.

1396
00:57:07,570 --> 00:57:08,570
(Move it.)

1397
00:57:09,070 --> 00:57:10,210
- Hold on.
- None have burst.

1398
00:57:12,140 --> 00:57:13,740
- What? Why are they so fast?
- You Seok.

1399
00:57:13,740 --> 00:57:16,380
Sun Young, You Seok is picking the ones on the ground.

1400
00:57:16,380 --> 00:57:17,410
I'm sorry.

1401
00:57:17,410 --> 00:57:18,480
- I don't have the time to respond.
- All are yellow.

1402
00:57:19,280 --> 00:57:20,380
I can't respond to you.

1403
00:57:20,380 --> 00:57:21,680
Yoon Seo is super fast.

1404
00:57:22,850 --> 00:57:24,350
How is she that fast?

1405
00:57:24,890 --> 00:57:26,960
Yoon Seo's basket gave me a shock.

1406
00:57:28,090 --> 00:57:29,160
(The youngsters won't lose.)

1407
00:57:29,890 --> 00:57:31,590
(The two spotted the same target.)

1408
00:57:32,390 --> 00:57:33,500
No, don't...

1409
00:57:34,960 --> 00:57:37,170
What's wrong with you? I'm not stealing yours.

1410
00:57:37,270 --> 00:57:38,630
It was my spot, you know?

1411
00:57:39,900 --> 00:57:41,440
There’s no yours or mine here.

1412
00:57:41,440 --> 00:57:42,540
(He pushes him away.)

1413
00:57:42,700 --> 00:57:44,040
What a weirdo.

1414
00:57:44,040 --> 00:57:45,270
- Yoon Seo.
- I was already harvesting them.

1415
00:57:45,270 --> 00:57:46,540
Stop following me around.

1416
00:57:46,540 --> 00:57:48,110
- There aren't any here.
- Stay away.

1417
00:57:48,580 --> 00:57:50,380
I'd better pick fast while they're fighting.

1418
00:57:51,450 --> 00:57:54,380
Can't you two fight longer? You two.

1419
00:57:55,020 --> 00:57:56,950
Guys. Don't you need to chat?

1420
00:57:57,590 --> 00:57:58,590
(Groaning)

1421
00:57:58,590 --> 00:57:59,860
- Oh, dear.
- Gosh.

1422
00:57:59,960 --> 00:58:02,520
(The aftermath of going overboard with passion)

1423
00:58:03,390 --> 00:58:05,130
There aren't any trees with red plums.

1424
00:58:07,130 --> 00:58:10,070
(Jumping)

1425
00:58:10,630 --> 00:58:12,770
(All that's left are red plums up high.)

1426
00:58:12,770 --> 00:58:13,770
Nice.

1427
00:58:15,100 --> 00:58:16,170
I'm going up.

1428
00:58:17,340 --> 00:58:21,640
(Yoon Seo secures an empty basket as well.)

1429
00:58:21,640 --> 00:58:23,410
I found a spot with a bunch earlier.

1430
00:58:23,410 --> 00:58:24,450
(Searching for the red plums she missed)

1431
00:58:25,610 --> 00:58:27,020
There are so many branches.

1432
00:58:27,020 --> 00:58:28,250
(It's much easier when standing on top of a basket.)

1433
00:58:29,180 --> 00:58:31,920
(The determination not to miss a single red plum)

1434
00:58:31,920 --> 00:58:33,220
You have to step back to spot them.

1435
00:58:33,220 --> 00:58:34,790
Let me look for some.

1436
00:58:34,790 --> 00:58:36,190
- Here they are.
- Oh, dear.

1437
00:58:37,730 --> 00:58:38,730
Right here.

1438
00:58:39,390 --> 00:58:40,460
Two red plums here.

1439
00:58:40,460 --> 00:58:41,830
(She works hard until the very end.)

1440
00:58:42,360 --> 00:58:43,830
- It's empty, right?
- Yes.

1441
00:58:44,700 --> 00:58:46,000
(Checking again from afar)

1442
00:58:46,000 --> 00:58:47,100
From the outside...

1443
00:58:48,200 --> 00:58:49,570
We picked every single red plum.

1444
00:58:50,370 --> 00:58:51,470
Over there too.

1445
00:58:52,510 --> 00:58:54,510
The red plums look very charming.

1446
00:58:54,510 --> 00:58:56,380
- Right? The color is...
- They're like gems.

1447
00:58:56,380 --> 00:58:57,450
The plums look magical.

1448
00:58:57,450 --> 00:58:59,110
It can't be replicated with paint.

1449
00:58:59,950 --> 00:59:01,520
Do you know what my life goal is?

1450
00:59:02,520 --> 00:59:03,520
What I want to do...

1451
00:59:04,190 --> 00:59:06,820
more than a commercial for Chanel is a plum juice commercial.

1452
00:59:07,220 --> 00:59:08,690
It's my favorite beverage.

1453
00:59:08,690 --> 00:59:09,890
(A plum juice commercial is his life goal.)

1454
00:59:10,160 --> 00:59:13,090
(The legendary commercial from back then)

1455
00:59:14,500 --> 00:59:17,630
(Cute and tangy, just like a plum)

1456
00:59:17,970 --> 00:59:20,170
(I like you.)

1457
00:59:20,170 --> 00:59:22,470
(The plum heir's lifelong wish)

1458
00:59:23,270 --> 00:59:25,510
Are you ready? I'll do it from up here.

1459
00:59:25,770 --> 00:59:26,940
Tell me once you get the angle.

1460
00:59:26,940 --> 00:59:27,980
No, I'll...

1461
00:59:29,310 --> 00:59:30,680
Please get one full shot...

1462
00:59:30,680 --> 00:59:32,980
and one close-up of my hand. We have several cameras.

1463
00:59:33,380 --> 00:59:34,850
- Who will take the full shot?
- Me.

1464
00:59:34,850 --> 00:59:36,080
Full shot? Okay.

1465
00:59:36,080 --> 00:59:37,450
- Nice. It's a good shot.
- Here we go.

1466
00:59:37,450 --> 00:59:39,020
- Here we go.
- You're the main camera.

1467
00:59:39,020 --> 00:59:40,190
Camera roll.

1468
00:59:40,660 --> 00:59:42,890
Ready. Action.

1469
00:59:43,630 --> 00:59:47,800
(A smooth start, following the game plan)

1470
00:59:48,760 --> 00:59:51,100
I like you.

1471
00:59:51,100 --> 00:59:52,930
(Dear plum, I like you.)

1472
00:59:53,300 --> 00:59:54,940
Do you also like me?

1473
00:59:56,070 --> 00:59:57,840
I want to bite you.

1474
00:59:59,540 --> 01:00:01,810
(Kissing)

1475
01:00:05,480 --> 01:00:09,720
(It's hard to watch her friend on business mode.)

1476
01:00:09,850 --> 01:00:12,150
Goodness... He's terribly good.

1477
01:00:12,150 --> 01:00:13,960
(Review: He's terribly good.)

1478
01:00:13,960 --> 01:00:14,960
I acknowledge him.

1479
01:00:16,260 --> 01:00:18,160
(Desperately looking forward to the advertisers' calls)

1480
01:00:18,160 --> 01:00:19,190
Okay.

1481
01:00:20,460 --> 01:00:21,700
- Nice.
- Lend me the green plums.

1482
01:00:23,000 --> 01:00:24,830
(She turns out to be a competitor, not an assistant staff.)

1483
01:00:25,470 --> 01:00:27,740
(After borrowing the props, she's ready right away.)

1484
01:00:27,740 --> 01:00:29,200
(Action)

1485
01:00:33,510 --> 01:00:35,480
I want to bite you.

1486
01:00:42,220 --> 01:00:46,120
(Green plums may be pretty, but Yoon Seo is prettier.)

1487
01:00:46,390 --> 01:00:47,760
Gwangyang green plums.

1488
01:00:47,760 --> 01:00:49,420
(Gwangyang green plums are as refreshing as me.)

1489
01:00:50,030 --> 01:00:52,660
(The video won't end.)

1490
01:00:53,160 --> 01:00:54,400
It really looks like a commercial.

1491
01:00:55,160 --> 01:00:56,630
Did mine look like a fake one, then?

1492
01:00:59,270 --> 01:01:01,500
- I'm getting more shameless here.
- You only favor the youngest.

1493
01:01:02,070 --> 01:01:04,110
(My green plums commercial.)

1494
01:01:04,110 --> 01:01:05,540
Are you done picking?

1495
01:01:05,540 --> 01:01:08,540
- Yes.
- Let's go pick Japanese apricots.

1496
01:01:08,540 --> 01:01:10,150
- What?
- What apricots?

1497
01:01:10,150 --> 01:01:11,310
Japanese apricots.

1498
01:01:11,550 --> 01:01:12,810
- There's more?
- Yes.

1499
01:01:14,080 --> 01:01:16,620
(Meanwhile, at home)

1500
01:01:17,350 --> 01:01:19,590
(Before going to grocery shopping, Jung Ah...)

1501
01:01:20,020 --> 01:01:21,090
Pork ribs.

1502
01:01:21,720 --> 01:01:22,820
How much pork ribs should I buy?

1503
01:01:23,530 --> 01:01:26,360
How much do I need to buy to cook for 40 people?

1504
01:01:27,630 --> 01:01:30,200
(She is lost in thought to cook such a big portion.)

1505
01:01:30,700 --> 01:01:33,100
Add some shishito peppers.

1506
01:01:34,800 --> 01:01:37,070
(Let's go buy groceries before it's too late.)

1507
01:01:37,070 --> 01:01:39,040
- Let's go.
- Pork ribs, soju,

1508
01:01:39,040 --> 01:01:40,040
shiitake mushrooms, carrots,

1509
01:01:40,040 --> 01:01:41,880
radish, green onions, shishito peppers, coke.

1510
01:01:42,110 --> 01:01:44,550
- We should buy two watermelons.
- Right.

1511
01:01:45,350 --> 01:01:47,150
- Let's finish it in 20 minutes.
- Okay.

1512
01:01:47,150 --> 01:01:49,990
(They even decide the duration for grocery shopping.)

1513
01:01:50,490 --> 01:01:52,590
- It's 11:28am. Then...
- Right.

1514
01:01:53,290 --> 01:01:54,560
when we come back,

1515
01:01:55,120 --> 01:01:56,320
